trust() in scripts/host_requests.py trusts an item only when author_association is OWNER, user.type is User, performed_via_github_app is present and null (not created through a GitHub App), and the author's login is the repository owner. Anything else is untrusted, as the recipe says: the tracker trusts an issue only when the owner account wrote it.

